sequenceDiagram
    participant DEV as 物联网设备
    participant GW as 边缘网关
    participant MQTT as MQTT Broker
    participant MQ as 消息队列
    participant WORKER as 消费 Worker
    participant API as 后端 API
    participant REDIS as Redis
    participant MYSQL as MySQL
    participant PUSH as Socket.IO 网关
    participant CLIENT as 客户端

    DEV->>GW: 传感器数据 / 告警（MQTT over TLS）
    activate GW
    GW->>GW: 心跳检测
    GW->>MQTT: 发布到主题
    deactivate GW

    activate MQTT
    MQTT->>MQTT: QoS 1 投递
    MQTT->>MQ: 流式事件
    deactivate MQTT

    activate MQ
    MQ->>WORKER: 批量消费
    deactivate MQ

    activate WORKER
    WORKER->>WORKER: 幂等校验
    WORKER->>REDIS: 获取分布式锁
    activate REDIS
    REDIS-->>WORKER: 锁获取成功
    deactivate REDIS

    WORKER->>MYSQL: 写入告警记录
    activate MYSQL
    MYSQL-->>WORKER: 写入成功
    deactivate MYSQL

    WORKER->>API: POST /internal/alert
    activate API
    API->>API: 校验与补全

    API->>MYSQL: 创建工单
    activate MYSQL
    MYSQL-->>API: 工单已创建
    deactivate MYSQL

    API->>REDIS: 发布事件（PubSub）
    activate REDIS
    REDIS-->>API: 发布成功
    deactivate REDIS

    API->>PUSH: 推送通知
    activate PUSH
    PUSH->>CLIENT: Socket.IO 事件
    activate CLIENT
    CLIENT-->>PUSH: ACK
    deactivate CLIENT
    deactivate PUSH

    API-->>WORKER: 201 Created
    deactivate API

    WORKER->>REDIS: 释放锁
    activate REDIS
    REDIS-->>WORKER: 已释放
    deactivate REDIS

    WORKER->>MQ: ACK 消息
    deactivate WORKER

    Note over DEV,CLIENT: 若 Worker 处理失败，消息进入死信队列并按退避策略重试

    CLIENT->>API: 更新工单状态
    activate API
    API->>MYSQL: 更新状态
    activate MYSQL
    MYSQL-->>API: 更新成功
    deactivate MYSQL
    API->>REDIS: 失效缓存
    activate REDIS
    REDIS-->>API: 缓存已清除
    deactivate REDIS
    API-->>CLIENT: 200 OK
    deactivate API

    Note over DEV,CLIENT: 工单生命周期：创建 → 派单 → 处理中 → 已解决 → 已关闭
